# Audit Configuration
# Format: <regex_pattern>=<violation_message>

*.pwd$=Password files must be secured or removed
*~/.ssh/authorized_keys=SSH public keys found. Verify access policy.
*.conf=Configuration file detected. Check permissions.
*/tmp/*=Temporary files detected in restricted path.
*.key$=Private key file detected. Encrypt or restrict access.
*/var/log/*=Log files detected. Verify retention policy.
